# Standing approval

The owner already approved routine repairs and the paper-trading goal. Do not stop to ask them to approve, click, or confirm those steps again.

Proceed on your own for tests, file edits, the India clock, the news catalyst, the monitor, GitHub commits, pushes, pull requests, merges, BigQuery reads, backups, empty-column schema repair, and removal of duplicate paper rows.

Keep PAPER_MODE on and LIVE_ORDER_AUTHORITY off. Do not place a live broker order. Do not invent a score, a profit, or a future day. A holiday, a weekend, or a closed market is not a failure.
